<codeline lineno="7"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>@section<sp/>EventSelection_intro<sp/>Introduction</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="8"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>The<sp/>`Event`<sp/>class,<sp/>implemented<sp/>in<sp/>Cython,<sp/>is<sp/>a<sp/>specialized<sp/>selection<sp/>template<sp/>within<sp/>the<sp/>AnalysisG<sp/>framework,<sp/>designed<sp/>for<sp/>generic<sp/>event<sp/>selection<sp/>in<sp/>Monte<sp/>Carlo<sp/>16<sp/>(MC16)<sp/>events.<sp/>It<sp/>inherits<sp/>from<sp/>the<sp/>generic<sp/>`SelectionTemplate`<sp/>class,<sp/>providing<sp/>a<sp/>foundational<sp/>structure<sp/>for<sp/>event-level<sp/>filtering.<sp/>While<sp/>its<sp/>`transform_dict_keys`<sp/>method<sp/>is<sp/>currently<sp/>empty,<sp/>it<sp/>serves<sp/>as<sp/>a<sp/>placeholder<sp/>for<sp/>potential<sp/>future<sp/>data<sp/>exposure<sp/>from<sp/>the<sp/>underlying<sp/>C++<sp/>event<sp/>selection<sp/>logic.</highlight></codeline>
